  "short_description": "<p>Handwoven bamboo boxes from Vietnam – eco-friendly, durable, and beautiful for storage, packaging, and decoration. Wholesale supplier &amp; manufacturer with custom designs available.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"433\">Vietnam is a leading source for <strong data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"253\">woven bamboo boxes</strong>, handmade by skilled artisans using eco-friendly materials. These boxes are ideal for <strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"383\">storage, gift packaging, and home décor</strong>, available in various sizes and custom designs.</p>\n<p data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"548\">Our <strong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"294\">woven bamboo boxes</strong> are crafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans using natural, eco-friendly bamboo. Each box is carefully handwoven, offering durability, light weight, and a beautiful natural look that makes it perfect for <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"545\">storage, gift packaging, and home decoration</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"780\">We supply these bamboo boxes in various sizes, shapes (square, round, oval), and finishes (natural, polished, painted, or lacquered). Custom designs, logo printing, and sustainable packaging solutions are available upon request.</p>\n<p data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"1028\">By working with us, you not only receive high-quality handcrafted products, but also support rural artisans in Vietnam. This traditional craft provides jobs, maintains cultural heritage, and helps generate sustainable income for local families.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1309\"><strong data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1069\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:</strong><br data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1072\" />Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd specializes in wholesale production and export of natural woven bamboo products. We provide competitive pricing, international shipping, and custom orders for retailers, wholesalers, and importers worldwide.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1396\">For bulk orders or OEM inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1393\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1391\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong>.</p>",
